    "detailed_description": "Welcome to <strong>Night Light City</strong>, a dark, dystopian sentient alien City. You play as a seductive and powerful female bioweapon, feared by a sentient city and wanted by four factions. How she responds is up to you, as you discover the secrets of Night Light City. Immerse yourself into a cyberpunk 2D cinematic metroidvaina and beat 'em up hybrid.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/aba1201c62c4e43d89c1c70ddf17b582.poster.avif?t=1696624704\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/aba1201c62c4e43d89c1c70ddf17b582.webm?t=1696624704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/aba1201c62c4e43d89c1c70ddf17b582.mp4?t=1696624704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Uncover the secrets and truth of this dark sentient city as a hard-boiled alien detective</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Utilise your monstrous powers and devour your prey and merge with their DNA to restore or instill your reputation. Your cases will include simple to mature-themed scenarios</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Experience the sentient emote system that you can use to interrogate, manipulate, terrorize, or sway the odds in your favor</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Feel like a powerful alien bioweapon as you unleash your unstoppable powers and devour and absorb the DNA of your prey and unleash it into the City</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Combat and hunt down sentient enemies of varying species and sizes, using the slick combo, guns, weapons, and different DNA-infused move-sets to crush your foes</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Put your agile and athletic body to use as you parkour, doge, slide, fight, impale, hack, devour and hunt your prey</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Engage in an epic True Film Noir, and neo Cyberpunk story with bustling culture and characters to discover and explore along the way. Each case, small or big will reveal your true nature</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/90a86bfc031c77c6f0d3a31cc2186fdd.poster.avif?t=1696624704\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/90a86bfc031c77c6f0d3a31cc2186fdd.webm?t=1696624704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/90a86bfc031c77c6f0d3a31cc2186fdd.mp4?t=1696624704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to <strong>Night Light City</strong>, a dark, dystopian sentient alien City. You play as a seductive and powerful female bioweapon, feared by a sentient city and wanted by four factions. How she responds is up to you, as you discover the secrets of Night Light City. Immerse yourself into a cyberpunk 2D cinematic metroidvaina and beat 'em up hybrid.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/aba1201c62c4e43d89c1c70ddf17b582.poster.avif?t=1696624704\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/aba1201c62c4e43d89c1c70ddf17b582.webm?t=1696624704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/aba1201c62c4e43d89c1c70ddf17b582.mp4?t=1696624704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Uncover the secrets and truth of this dark sentient city as a hard-boiled alien detective</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Utilise your monstrous powers and devour your prey and merge with their DNA to restore or instill your reputation. Your cases will include simple to mature-themed scenarios</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Experience the sentient emote system that you can use to interrogate, manipulate, terrorize, or sway the odds in your favor</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Feel like a powerful alien bioweapon as you unleash your unstoppable powers and devour and absorb the DNA of your prey and unleash it into the City</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Combat and hunt down sentient enemies of varying species and sizes, using the slick combo, guns, weapons, and different DNA-infused move-sets to crush your foes</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Put your agile and athletic body to use as you parkour, doge, slide, fight, impale, hack, devour and hunt your prey</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1696624704\" /></div> <strong> Engage in an epic True Film Noir, and neo Cyberpunk story with bustling culture and characters to discover and explore along the way. Each case, small or big will reveal your true nature</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/90a86bfc031c77c6f0d3a31cc2186fdd.poster.avif?t=1696624704\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/90a86bfc031c77c6f0d3a31cc2186fdd.webm?t=1696624704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.aka